{"page":412,"width":1604,"height":2198,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"진입 간선이 없는 C와 G 중에서 G를 리스트에 추가하고 G와 진출 간선을 함께 제거합니다.","words":[{"text":"진입","x":163,"y":187,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"간선이","x":227,"y":188,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"없는","x":319,"y":188,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"C와","x":380,"y":188,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"G","x":438,"y":192,"width":23,"height":26},{"text":"중에서","x":473,"y":188,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"G를","x":563,"y":190,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"리스트에","x":626,"y":188,"width":103,"height":32},{"text":"추가하고","x":739,"y":188,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"G와","x":856,"y":188,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"진출","x":920,"y":188,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"간선을","x":983,"y":188,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"함께","x":1077,"y":189,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"제거합니다.","x":1146,"y":187,"width":154,"height":35}]},{"text":"제거 대상 후보가 C 하나입니다. 리스트에 이 정점을 추가하고 진출 간선과 함께 제거합니다.","words":[{"text":"제거","x":164,"y":679,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"대상","x":225,"y":679,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"후보가","x":288,"y":677,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"C","x":380,"y":681,"width":20,"height":25},{"text":"하나입니다.","x":411,"y":677,"width":145,"height":32},{"text":"리스트에","x":570,"y":677,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"이","x":687,"y":677,"width":23,"height":32},{"text":"정점을","x":723,"y":677,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"추가하고","x":810,"y":676,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"진출","x":929,"y":675,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"간선과","x":993,"y":675,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"함께","x":1088,"y":676,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"제거합니다.","x":1156,"y":674,"width":155,"height":33}]},{"text":"그다•음은 F입니다. 역시 리스트에 추가하고 해당 정점과 진출 간선을 제거합니다.","words":[{"text":"그다•음은","x":166,"y":1060,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"F입니다.","x":279,"y":1059,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"역시","x":400,"y":1059,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"리스트에","x":464,"y":1059,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"추가하고","x":581,"y":1058,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"해당","x":699,"y":1056,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"정점과","x":763,"y":1056,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"진출","x":853,"y":1056,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"간선을","x":915,"y":1056,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"제거합니다.","x":1006,"y":1056,"width":149,"height":32}]},{"text":"마지막으로 남은 정점 H를 리스트에 추가합니다. 이것으로 위상 정렬이 끝났습니다. 완성된 리스트","words":[{"text":"마지막으로","x":170,"y":1442,"width":130,"height":31},{"text":"남은","x":309,"y":1441,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"정점","x":374,"y":1440,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"H를","x":436,"y":1440,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"리스트에","x":500,"y":1438,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"추가합니다.","x":617,"y":1437,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"이것으로","x":772,"y":1437,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"위상","x":890,"y":1437,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"정렬이","x":953,"y":1437,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"끝났습니다.","x":1044,"y":1435,"width":149,"height":32},{"text":"완성된","x":1206,"y":1435,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"리스트","x":1312,"y":1436,"width":96,"height":30}]},{"text":"가 바로 그래프를 위상 정렬한 결과입니다.","words":[{"text":"가","x":171,"y":1502,"width":26,"height":31},{"text":"바로","x":205,"y":1502,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"그래프를","x":265,"y":1500,"width":108,"height":31},{"text":"위상","x":382,"y":1500,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"정렬한","x":446,"y":1498,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"결과입니다.","x":538,"y":1498,"width":142,"height":32}]},{"text":"이 알고리즘은 이해하기 쉬우며 자신의 임무를 제대로 해냅니다. 이 알고리즘과 똑같이 위상을 정렬","words":[{"text":"이","x":172,"y":1830,"width":24,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":208,"y":1831,"width":136,"height":30},{"text":"이해하기","x":353,"y":1832,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"쉬우며","x":473,"y":1831,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"자신의","x":561,"y":1832,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"임무를","x":651,"y":1832,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"제대로","x":739,"y":1832,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"해냅니다.","x":826,"y":1830,"width":114,"height":31},{"text":"이","x":953,"y":1830,"width":25,"height":30},{"text":"알고리즘과","x":990,"y":1829,"width":139,"height":31},{"text":"똑같이","x":1137,"y":1829,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"위상을","x":1236,"y":1828,"width":94,"height":31},{"text":"정렬","x":1341,"y":1827,"width":62,"height":31}]},{"text":"하지만 조금 더 우아하게 문제를 푸는 알고리즘도 있습니다. 바로 깊이 우선 탐색을 이용한 위상 정","words":[{"text":"하지만","x":172,"y":1888,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"조금","x":261,"y":1889,"width":57,"height":27},{"text":"더","x":329,"y":1888,"width":23,"height":29},{"text":"우아하게","x":365,"y":1888,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"문제를","x":484,"y":1888,"width":80,"height":29},{"text":"푸는","x":573,"y":1889,"width":54,"height":28},{"text":"알고리즘도","x":635,"y":1888,"width":130,"height":30},{"text":"있습니다.","x":776,"y":1888,"width":112,"height":30},{"text":"바로","x":902,"y":1888,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"깊이","x":968,"y":1887,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"우선","x":1030,"y":1887,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"탐색을","x":1096,"y":1887,"width":88,"height":30},{"text":"이용한","x":1194,"y":1887,"width":92,"height":31},{"text":"위상","x":1297,"y":1885,"width":65,"height":31},{"text":"정","x":1373,"y":1885,"width":28,"height":31}]},{"text":"410 Part 02 • 일고리좀","words":[{"text":"410","x":169,"y":2070,"width":47,"height":22},{"text":"Part","x":244,"y":2070,"width":51,"height":21},{"text":"02","x":303,"y":2069,"width":31,"height":21},{"text":"•","x":342,"y":2078,"width":5,"height":5},{"text":"일고리좀","x":355,"y":2069,"width":88,"height":22}]}]}